   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## LTX-2.5 I2V start (+ optional end) frame - RTX 3090\n\n**Stage 1** renders at the size in group 2 (default 960x544, 121 frames = 5 s @ 24 fps).\n**Stage 2** upscales x2 in latent space -> 1920x1088 and refines 3 steps.\n\n**End frame:** select both `END-FRAME guide` nodes and press **Ctrl+B** (bypass) to run start-image only.\n\n**Fast tests:** set width/height to 768x448 and/or frames to 97. Final size is always 2x the stage-1 size.\n\n**OOM?** 1) lower VAE Decode tile_size 512 -> 384/256, 2) use Q5/Q4 GGUF, 3) fewer frames, 4) launch with `--reserve-vram 1`.\n\n**Seeds:** stage 1 = randomize. When you like a result, set it to fixed.\n"
   ]
  }
